1. Transpose the matrix: Iterate over the matrix and swap each element (i, j) with its corresponding element (j, i). This step transforms rows into columns.
2. Reverse each row: Iterate over each row in the transposed matrix and reverse the elements. This step ensures the rotation in a clockwise direction.', '2026-04-06T15:59:11.573Z'
);

